N2  - Across 13 studies, strength and power gains were similar overall and greater when stopping short if volumes were not matched. Muscle growth was moderately greater with failure overall (SMD 0.75), but there was no difference when training volumes were matched.
N1  - Systematic review with meta-analysis of 13 studies (J Strength Cond Res 2021;35(4):1165-1175; Vieira, Umpierre, Teodoro, Lisboa, Baroni, Izquierdo, Cadore). Not verified 2026-10-14. Used for: training.proximity_to_failure: contradicts
